#: main.py:1235
msgid ""
"Request this playlist's missing albums from your configured Lidarr "
"instance, monitor-only — Lidarr's own scheduled search finds them later."
msgstr ""
"Demander à votre instance Lidarr configurée les albums manquants de cette"
" playlist, en mode surveillance uniquement — la recherche planifiée de "
"Lidarr les trouvera ensuite."

#: main.py:1236
